	<#bbbbbb>Health: 1500</>
	<#bbbbbb>This move list assumes you are facing to the right.</>
	<#7f41b9>UNIQUE TRAIT: THE FUNDAMENTALS OF MAGIC</>
	Yuko's moves can be modified with Imagination and Motivation.
	Imagination is gained by attacking the enemy, and lost by taking
	damage or by not landing any attacks. Motivation is gained in a
	variety of ways, and can be spent to expand Yuko's moveset.

	<#7f41b9>IMAGINATION GAUGE</>
	The different levels drastically change Yuko's capabilities.
	It is strongly encouraged to check the rest of the movelist
	to understand the full extent of Imagination's effects.
	<#818181>LEVEL 0: All damage is decreased.</>
	<#ffd541>LEVELS 1-2: Yuko's default state.</>
	<#f0710a>LEVEL 3: All of Yuko's Special Moves become enhanced.</>
	<#ff0000>LEVEL 4: Devil-Chain Enders refund all Momentum used
	during the chain.</>

